---
import img1 from '../assets/images/Bamboo 257.png';
import img2 from '../assets/images/Indoor_Plant.png';
import img3 from '../assets/images/Outdoor_Plant.png';
---

<section class="section-about">
 <div class="padding-global padding-top-medium padding-bottom-large">
    <div class="container-large">
        <div class="about_component">
            <div class="about_content-wrapper">
                <h2 class="about_content-heading h2">We Help choose the most suitable plants for you</h2>
                <p class="about_paragraph">Our selection includes a wide variety of flowers, from classic roses to exotic orchids, as well as a variety of lush indoor and outdoor plants and also offer unique floral arrangements that are perfect for any occasion, whether you're looking to brighten up your home or send a thoughtful gift. </p>
            </div>
            <div class="about_features-wrapper">
                <div class="about_features-card">
                    <img src={img2.src} alt="" class="about_features-card-image" />
                    <p class="about_features-card-name">Indoor Plants</p>
                    <p class="about_features-card-text">Bring the beauty of nature to your outdoor spaces with our wide selection of outdoor plants</p>
                </div>

                <div class="about_features-card is-second">
                    <img src={img3.src} alt="" class="about_features-card-image" />
                    <p class="about_features-card-name ">Outdoor Plants</p>
                    <p class="about_features-card-text">Bring a touch of greenery to your living spaces with our collection of indoor plants, perfect for purifying the air and adding a natural touch to your home.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="about_features-card">
                    <img src={img1.src} alt="" class="about_features-card-image" />
                    <p class="about_features-card-name">Plants Pots</p>
                    <p class="about_features-card-text">Add a touch of style to your indoor or outdoor spaces with our collection of pots plants, available in a variety of sizes and designs to fit any decor</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
 </div>
</section>